      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "In the episode's dramatic finale, the lead actress delivers a stinging goodbye, federal agents tipped off by the coordinator raid the hotel to arrest Muranishi, and Muranishi answers reporters with an unforgettable line about a rumored 370-year sentence. Let's listen in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
